OL,3,GNEWSABoy abducted by mum has renewed
OL,4,A'sense of purpose'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlex Batty, who disappeared for six
OL,7,Fyears after being abducted by his
OL,8,Fmother as a child, has described
OL,9,Ffeeling a renewed "sense of purpose"
OL,10,Fafter finding work.
OL,12,FBatty, from Oldham, was declared
OL,13,Fmissing by his grandmother in 2017,
OL,14,Faged 11, after his mother and
OL,15,Fgrandfather failed to return him from a
OL,16,Fholiday in Spain and instead moved to
OL,17,FFrance.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
