OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABoy abducted by mum has renewed
OL,4,A'sense of purpose'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe spent the following years in
OL,7,Fisolation before he was spotted by a
OL,8,Fdelivery driver in December 2023 in the
OL,9,Ffoothills of the Pyrenees in the
OL,10,Fsouth-west of the country.
OL,12,FBatty, who is now 20, said his job at a
OL,13,Fwaste management company had given his
OL,14,Fyoung family financial security.
